{"id":"dc27d1abcea524e3","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-single-letter-fixed-point.md","title":"Correctness of the Bounded Single-Letter Construction","display":"thm-single-letter-fixed-point — Correctness of the Bounded Single-Letter Construction","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-single-letter-fixed-point","aliases":["89-thm-single-letter-fixed-point"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"thm-single-letter-fixed-point — Correctness of the Bounded Single-Letter Construction","depends_on":["[[89-df-single-letter-fixed-algorithm]]","[[89-lem-single-letter-trace-stability]]","[[89-lem-single-letter-trace-semantics]]","[[89-thm-letterless-rank-trace]]","[[89-thm-letterless-normal-form]]","[[89-lem-generated-submodel]]","[[89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point]]","[[89-df-fixed-point]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-single-letter-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-single-letter-fixed-point</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-single-letter-fixed-point — Correctness of the Bounded Single-Letter Construction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"94d543cad7d7ee3b\" href=\"?note=94d543cad7d7ee3b\" title=\"89-df-single-letter-fixed-algorithm\">89-df-single-letter-fixed-algorithm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5200c72d06d4734b\" href=\"?note=5200c72d06d4734b\" title=\"89-lem-single-letter-trace-stability\">89-lem-single-letter-trace-stability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8e21aff80559d65a\" href=\"?note=8e21aff80559d65a\" title=\"89-lem-single-letter-trace-semantics\">89-lem-single-letter-trace-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7a04766d8c28cddc\" href=\"?note=7a04766d8c28cddc\" title=\"89-thm-letterless-rank-trace\">89-thm-letterless-rank-trace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c45e0059ab7065e5\" href=\"?note=c45e0059ab7065e5\" title=\"89-thm-letterless-normal-form\">89-thm-letterless-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d41420ede99a3508\" href=\"?note=d41420ede99a3508\" title=\"89-lem-generated-submodel\">89-lem-generated-submodel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a0b83ca065132609\" href=\"?note=a0b83ca065132609\" title=\"89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point\">89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"85e306b51d3267ec\" href=\"?note=85e306b51d3267ec\" title=\"89-df-fixed-point\">89-df-fixed-point</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 仅含字母 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 且关于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 模态化；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=H^{\\mathrm{tr}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\">\\(H=H^{\\mathrm{tr}}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> 是原书加强不动点谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{md}\">\\(\\mathrm{md}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b_{\\Box}\">\\(b_{\\Box}\\)</span> 是度数和盒子公式计数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t_A\">\\(t_A\\)</span> 为 A-trace。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}single\\text{-}letter\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,H)\n\\land\\mathrm{md}(H)\\le b_{\\Box}(A)\n\\land\\mathrm{tr}(H)=\\{k\\in\\omega:t_A(A,k)=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}single\\text{-}letter\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BookFix}_{\\mathrm{GL}}(A,p,H)\n\\land\\mathrm{md}(H)\\le b_{\\Box}(A)\n\\land\\mathrm{tr}(H)=\\{k\\in\\omega:t_A(A,k)=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 108–111；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>秩标记的单点迹与稳定性给最后一式及度数界。任取有限 GL 模型中满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\">\\(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span>；在生成子模型内所有世界满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p=A\">\\(p=A\\)</span>，且它仍是有限 GL 模型。A-trace 秩语义给当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 值，普通无字母秩语义给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 值，二者由迹相同而吻合。生成子模型真值保持与有限 GL 完全性得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\to(p\\leftrightarrow H)\">\\(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\to(p\\leftrightarrow H)\\)</span> 可证；Goldfarb 判据升级为完整等价。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 无字母，所以满足原书的字母限制。本证明独立于一般不动点存在定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-single-letter-fixed-algorithm","status":"resolved","id":"94d543cad7d7ee3b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-single-letter-fixed-algorithm]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-single-letter-trace-stability","status":"resolved","id":"5200c72d06d4734b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-single-letter-trace-stability]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-single-letter-trace-semantics","st